# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# Fix typo slug discovered via GSC "Page with redirect" report
# (typo: 1210-vs-9610-0110 missing the second "vs"). External sources
# still link to the typo; 301 to the correct page.
/insights/1210-vs-9610-0110.html  /insights/1210-vs-9610-vs-0110.html  301

# Canonical-stability rules: force extensionless requests to the .html
# authority URL (matching <link rel="canonical"> and sitemap). Prevents
# Cloudflare's automatic trailing-slash from leaving .html pages in GSC's
# "Page with redirect" queue. These patterns only match extensionless
# paths, so they never loop with the .html files themselves.
/insights/:slug  /insights/:slug.html  301
/ecommerce-operations  /ecommerce-operations.html  301
/bonded-warehouse-cost-process  /bonded-warehouse-cost-process.html  301
